    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nNo. 5 Annbrook Heights is a well-presented three-bedroom semi-detached property ideally located within a few minutes' walk of Nenagh town centre and all its amenities. Occupying a generous corner site, the property benefits from a large garden and enjoys an excellent degree of privacy, with the property not overlooked.\n\nThe accommodation extends to approximately 80. sq. m. and comprises an entrance hallway, living room and kitchen/dining room on the ground floor. Upstairs, there are three bedrooms together with a family shower room.\n\nExternally, the property benefits from a substantial garden due to its corner-site position, providing excellent outdoor space and potential for further landscaping. There is also a garage, currently used for storage, together with a utility room.\n\nThe property is heated by oil-fired central heating and all mains services are connected.\n\nLocated close to Nenagh town centre, the property is within easy reach of shops, schools, restaurants and a wide range of local amenities. This is an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, those looking to downsize or investors seeking a well-located property with strong potential."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 4.51m x 1.79m\ntiled floor and under stairs storage\n\nLiving Room - 3.88m x 3.48m\nlaminate flooring and solid fuel stove\n\nKitchen / Dining Room - 5.36m x 3.04m\ntiled floor and fitted kitchen units\n\nBedroom One - 3.39m x 3.04m\ncarpet flooring and built in wardrobe\n\nBedroom Two - 3.88m x 2.73m\ncarpet flooring and built in wardrobe\n\nBedroom Three - 2.8m x 2.59m\nlaminate flooring and built in wardrobe\n\nShower Room - 1.94m x 1.79m\nfully tiled, wc, handbasin and electric shower\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Mains water & sewerage</li><li>Oil Fired Central Heating</li><li>C Energy Rating</li><li>Large corner site</li><li>Not overlooked </li><li></li><li>* Dog kennels not included *</ul>"
      },
